Preface
This Master’s thesis has been performed from January to June 2012 at VTI’s Göteborg office, and it is done in collaboration between VTI and Chalmers University of Technology.
During the thesis, a new vehicle dynamics model for driving simulators has been developed and validated with test track experiments at Stora Holm Test Track, Göteborg, and also with simulator experiments performed at VTI’s newest simulator SimIV.
